      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a bit hard to follow.\n\nOn first connect, we get CMD_PRIVATE_DNS_SETTINGS_CHANGED and then CMD_NETWORK_CONNECTED. The former causes us to send ourselves a CMD_EVALUATE_PRIVATE_DNS and the latter enters EvaluatingState. When entering that state we send ourselves CMD_REEVALUATE. So we actually process CMD_EVALUATE_PRIVATE_DNS before we start our first captive portal probe. But we ignore it, because CMD_EVALUATE_PRIVATE_DNS is ignored in EvaluatingState.\n\nLooks OK to me. It might be possible to simplify it, but not in this CL :-)",
